{"data":{"id":"10.5281/zenodo.23304857","type":"dois","attributes":{"doi":"10.5281/zenodo.23304857","prefix":"10.5281","suffix":"zenodo.23304857","identifiers":[{"identifier":"oai:zenodo.org:23304857","identifierType":"oai"}],"alternateIdentifiers":[{"alternateIdentifierType":"oai","alternateIdentifier":"oai:zenodo.org:23304857"}],"creators":[{"name":"Butt, Naveed Islam","nameType":"Personal","givenName":"Naveed Islam","familyName":"Butt","nameIdentifiers":[],"affiliation":[]}],"titles":[{"title":"Assessing Limited Political Engagement with the Afghanistan United Front"}],"publisher":"Zenodo","container":{},"publicationYear":2026,"subjects":[{"subject":"Afghanistan"},{"subject":"Pakistan"},{"subject":"Afghanistan United Front"},{"subject":"Regional security"},{"subject":"Counterterrorism"}],"contributors":[],"dates":[{"date":"2026-10-11","dateType":"Issued"}],"language":"en","types":{"ris":"RRPT","bibtex":"misc","citeproc":"report","schemaOrg":"Report","resourceType":"","resourceTypeGeneral":"Report"},"relatedIdentifiers":[{"relationType":"IsVersionOf","relatedIdentifier":"10.5281/zenodo.23127962","relatedIdentifierType":"DOI"}],"relatedItems":[],"sizes":[],"formats":[],"version":"1.5","rightsList":[{"rights":"Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International","rightsUri":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode","schemeUri":"https://spdx.org/licenses/","rightsIdentifier":"cc-by-4.0","rightsIdentifierScheme":"SPDX"},{"rights":"Copyright 2026 Naveed Islam Butt","rightsUri":"http://rightsstatements.org/vocab/InC/1.0/"}],"descriptions":[{"description":"Public reporting establishes publicly identifiable AUF leadership, declared political objectives, and claims of armed activity, while its cohesion, representative authority, sustained capacity, and effect on cross-border threats remain incompletely established. This assessment asks whether Pakistan and the United States should separately authorize limited, nonexclusive political examination of the AUF within wider Afghan consultations, existing Kabul channels, and domestic protection in Pakistan. The strategic objective is rights-respecting Afghan governance that prevents terrorist sanctuary, pursued first through verifiable change in Taliban conduct or, if such change remains unattainable and a credible Afghan-led alternative emerges, through an inclusive and lawful Afghan political transition.\n\nThe paper proposes a bounded decision process; it does not provide verified force estimates, establish that AUF activity reduces TTP violence, recommend recognition or security assistance, or endorse externally directed regime change. Territorial illustrations distinguish the overall Taliban administrative baseline from attributed opposition activity, disputed claims, and temporary episodes. They identify no safe bases, routes, or logistical access.\n\nVersion 1.5 is the public-release edition of the reviewed manuscript, prepared 11 October 2026. The evidence cutoff remains 3 October 2026; this is not a current intelligence estimate or an independently peer-reviewed finding. The paper contains 87 numbered references, three illustrations, explicit evaluation and stop criteria, an author biography, and source limitations.\n\nNaveed Islam Butt originated the proposal and conceptual integration and writes in a personal capacity. ChatGPT (OpenAI), under the author’s direction, assisted with literature discovery, source comparison, critical analysis, drafting, revision, evaluation requirements, diagrams, and formatting. The author retains responsibility for the manuscript, its interpretations and recommendations, and the accuracy of its claims and citations. AI assistance is not independent field verification, peer review, or specialist endorsement.","descriptionType":"Abstract"}],"geoLocations":[],"fundingReferences":[],"xml":"","url":"https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.23304857","contentUrl":null,"metadataVersion":0,"schemaVersion":"http://datacite.org/schema/kernel-4","source":"api","isActive":true,"state":"findable","reason":null,"viewCount":0,"viewsOverTime":[],"downloadCount":0,"downloadsOverTime":[],"referenceCount":0,"citationCount":0,"citationsOverTime":[],"partCount":0,"partOfCount":0,"versionCount":0,"versionOfCount":1,"created":"2026-10-11T20:58:22.000Z","registered":"2026-10-11T20:58:23.000Z","published":"2026","updated":"2026-10-11T20:58:23.000Z"},"relationships":{"client":{"data":{"id":"cern.zenodo","type":"clients"}},"provider":{"data":{"id":"cern","type":"providers"}},"media":{"data":{"id":"10.5281/zenodo.23304857","type":"media"}},"references":{"data":[]},"citations":{"data":[]},"parts":{"data":[]},"partOf":{"data":[]},"versions":{"data":[]},"versionOf":{"data":[{"id":"10.5281/zenodo.23127962","type":"dois"}]}}}}